  "patch_sha256": "2a0de520f0f19a7adc1b3c93dd820f1aa085996b4b2c54a575f219b58fae7040",
  "behavior": "Existing editable Universe datalist always offers exact Warhammer40K spelling as requested: Warhammer 40K, SCP, Eve Online, World of Warcraft. Union occurs after existing2000 learned-value bound so no previously offered learned/custom value is displaced and all four stay available in large catalogs. No selected value, book assignment, source/output, job or name entry is changed by offering suggestions.",
  "tests": "8/8 existing StoreTests PASS0.442s; one provider case covers2001 learned values plus saved custom and unchanged SQL rows. Existing complete inline-series DOM script PASS, proves four choices, existing learned value, free custom typing and choosing SCP. Initial DOM test looked for Universe in inline ask controls instead of full namesRows.inputs; test-only lookup corrected, raw failure preserved. All owned results normal closure/nativezero.",
  "runtime_scope": "No frontend product change, new control, layout, liveAPI/DB/Z/focus, build/full/native/release execution. Three code/test paths frozen for Sully integration; version0.26.0 remains Sully-owned.",
